\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 For your novel:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 1. Make a list of your cast. Give each character a one or two line description.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 2. Step back and make sure the descriptions are sufficiently different from each other.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 3. Give each character one quirk. Make them irritating to at least two other characters.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 4. Write a few "practice scenes" pairing two of the characters at random. These are great warm up exercises for your writing, and may generate actual plot ideas and twists.}}